{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜になれなくてごめんなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様の気持ちに答えれなくて苦しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと自分を磨いてもっと高い坂道登ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テッペン目指してかけあがります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜になってみせます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今、私は新幹線にいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族や友達！いろいろな人に挨拶してきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日は会えないかもしれないケド心は繋がってると信じてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族と離れるのは辛くて寂しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっとちゃんと素直に『ありがとう』や『ごめんなさい』とか素直に沢山いって！沢山喜んでもらえることしてきたかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って今になって思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワガママばかりしちゃって沢山迷惑かけて『大丈夫かな？』って多分母さんとか父さん！おにぃちゃんとかおばぁちゃん！もっと心配したかな？って思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと私がシッカリしてたら少しは迷惑かからなかったのかな.........？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも泣いてばかりはいられない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前を向いてがんばる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど今日だけ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山泣かして下さい！甘やかして下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃぁ最後は笑ったまあやandユッタンタン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/21/8206214/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/%E4%BF%AE%E6%AD%A3.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Bye"}],"source":"archive"}